        <h2>Dr. Nandita Shah</h2>
        <p>Dr. Nandita Shah is a homeopath, author and health educator who has spent more than three decades teaching that most chronic disease is rooted in lifestyle and is reversible. She founded SHARAN in 2005.</p>
        <p>In 2016 she received the <strong>Nari Shakti Puraskar</strong>, the highest civilian honour for women in India, awarded by the President of India.</p>
